  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Strengthening the Capacity in Urban Development Management in Response to Climate Change Through the Establishment of Urban Planning and Development Management Information System in Viet Nam (UPIS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Contribute to inclusive and sustainable urbanization by providing technical assistance and strategic guidance 2. Increase urban resilience against climate change by implementing an integrated urban data and information system in target cities of Binh Dinh, Kien Giang and Thai Nguyen provinces 3. Enhance the capability of managers in the application of information technology to urban planning and development management&#x25A3; &#xC2DC;&#xBC94;&#xB3C4;&#xC2DC;&#xC5D0; &#xB3C4;&#xC2DC;&#xC815;&#xBCF4;&#xC2DC;&#xC2A4;&#xD15C; &#xAD6C;&#xCD95;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD558;&#xC5EC; &#xAE30;&#xD6C4;&#xBCC0;&#xD654; &#xBC0F; &#xC7AC;&#xB09C;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xC751;&#xD558;&#xB294; &#xB3C4;&#xC2DC;&#xC758; &#xC790;&#xC0DD;&#xB825;&#xC744; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xD568;
&#x25A3; &#xAD00;&#xB9AC;&#xC790;&#xB4E4;&#xC758; &#xB3C4;&#xC2DC;&#xACC4;&#xD68D;&#xAC1C;&#xBC1C;&#xAD00;&#xB9AC;&#xB97C; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xC815;&#xBCF4;&#xC2DC;&#xC2A4;&#xD15C; &#xC0AC;&#xC6A9;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xD55C; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xD568;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Establishment of Guidelines, BPR, and ISP of Urban Planning and UPIS  2. Development of UPIS 3. Implementation of UPIS in Three Pilot Cities 4. Recommendation of Legal Framework 5. Improvement of Capacity</narrative>
  </description>
